    --- FAIL: TestMostlyCompetentModelStaysBounded/seed11 (0.59s)
        chaos_test.go:348: the last fifteen turns peaked at 48165 over a 40000 window (accepted=24 rejected=2 nudges=7); occasional mistakes must not break compression.
            The mechanism: a couple of ignored or failed nudges trip the attempt ladder, and suppression then lifts only after NudgeGrowthFloor (22500 tokens) of further growth — more than half this window. Nudging goes quiet at ~90% usage and does not resume before overflow. See noa.TestSuppressionReleaseFitsInsideTheWindow.
